<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide sees double-digit EPS growth.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide sees double-digit EPS growth.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Liquide aims at a double-digit growth in earnings per share over a period of two to five years, chairman Alain Joly told a analysts' meeting.</p>
<p>He said the group also aimed to raise its return on equity to 14 percent in that period, from 11.8 percent in 1996.</p>
</text>
